### 7.1 Root cause

The Stage 3 fact-checker added nine new footnotes ([^54]–[^62] in the before-gate draft) at the bottom of the existing footnote list. Because the underlying document text already used [^54] through [^62] for other content, inserting new definitions at those numbers created orphaned definitions, out-of-sequence markers, and `lineage_citation_mismatch` errors across dozens of claims.

